; CodeViser API Master configuration example for NXP S32K312 Cortex-M7

MULtiCore.PORT 20000

GLOBAL &QC_cpu
GLOBAL &QC_jtag_cfg

&QC_cpu="S32K312-M7"
&QC_jtag_cfg="chain"

DEBUG.HideDebugWindow OFF
DEBUG.ResponseTimeOut 10000.ms

SYStem.CPU S32K312-M7
SYStem.CONFIG DEBUGPORTTYPE JTAG

PRINT "CVD API Master ready - CPU=S32K312-M7, JTAG, PORT=20000"
